---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog
description: "Notes from LaunchBrick on AI agents for repetitive work. Posts go up after they are approved."
permalink: /blog/
---
<header class="page-head wrap">
  <h1>Blog</h1>
  <p class="page-intro">Notes on AI agents that take repetitive work off small businesses. A post goes live only after it is approved.</p>
</header>
<div class="wrap stack">
  <h2>Posts</h2>
  {% if collections.posts.length == 0 %}
  <p class="empty">No posts yet.</p>
  {% else %}
  <ul class="post-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <li>
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
      <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {% endif %}
  <h2>Planned guides</h2>
  <ul class="planned">
    <li><a href="/ai-automation-for-small-business/">AI automation for small business</a> (not written yet)</li>
    <li><a href="/ai-agents-explained/">AI agents explained</a> (not written yet)</li>
  </ul>
</div>
